  dialogue:
  - Ah, Sir Knight! Ready to save the kingdom, are we? Well, before you venture off,
    let me quickly explain the controls to you!
  - To move around, you can use A, D and SPACE. Press A to move left, D to move right
    and SPACE to make a jump.
  - "It\u2019s simple, really! You\u2019ll need these to explore the land and battle
    the evil forces."
  - Good luck, Sir Knight! The kingdom depends on you!
